        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.8.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 8.5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Tenilotu akenya ina kop nikincho Olaitoriani Enkai ino, niya aitaa enino, nimany ninye, nintoki ajo, ‘Kapik olaiguanani shumata nanu, anaa kulo oshon pooki laamanita;’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "indim iyie tukul atipika ilo aiguanani shumata iyie ogelu Olaitoriani Enkai ino. Obo loo lalashera linono indim ategelu metaa olaiguanani te shumata intae; mipikipiki oltung'ani loo loreren shumata intae leme olalashe linyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.10.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Ilai 10.28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.1.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Int 1.16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.9.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "9.28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nchoo olaiguanani eaku meitaa mbartan enyena kumok, nemeisho iltung'ana metorrinyoto aapuo Misiri ejo pee etum atopona mbartan enyena, amu kitiaka iyie Olaitoriani, ‘Mingil aekata aim ina oitoi.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
